{"id": "tea:madhurya-kadambini:3", "source": "src:madhurya-kadambini", "location": {"ref": "3"}, "paraphrase": "Unwanted things (anartha) are of four kinds: those arising from sin, from pious acts, from offences and from devotion itself (desire for gain, honour and prestige); unsteady practice passes through six phases: false enthusiasm, alternating zeal and slackness, indecision, struggle with sense objects, inability to keep vows, and delight in the external benefits of devotion.", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion"], "stage": "beginner", "stage_native": "bhajana-kriyā / anartha-nivṛtti"}, "types": ["practice"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:visvanatha-cakravartin"], "paths": ["pth:madhurya-kadambini-stages"], "obstacles": ["obs:anartha-four-kinds"], "terms": ["trm:anartha"], "notes": "Shower-level reference.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
{"id": "tea:madhurya-kadambini:4", "source": "src:madhurya-kadambini", "location": {"ref": "4"}, "paraphrase": "Steadiness (niṣṭhā) is reached when five obstacles no longer arise in practice: sleepiness (laya), distraction (vikṣepa), inability or indifference (apratipatti), residual impurity (kaṣāya) and relish of other pleasures (rasāsvāda).", "tags": {"level": "conventional", "standpoint": "seeker", "naya": null, "path": ["devotion", "meditation"], "stage": "intermediate", "stage_native": "niṣṭhā"}, "types": ["practice"], "coverage": ["A6"], "reported_by_opponent": false, "ai_translated": false, "fidelity": {"status": "unchecked"}, "extraction": {"method": "skeleton", "extractors": ["U16-bhedabheda"], "disagreements": []}, "teachers": ["tch:visvanatha-cakravartin"], "paths": ["pth:madhurya-kadambini-stages"], "obstacles": ["obs:laya", "obs:viksepa", "obs:apratipatti", "obs:kasaya", "obs:rasasvada"], "terms": ["trm:nistha"], "notes": "Shower-level reference.", "verification": {"level": "skeleton", "confidence": "low", "unverified": false, "checks": []}, "provenance": {"units": ["skeleton:U16-bhedabheda"], "phases": ["skeleton"]}}
